        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>Top N created using this tutorial : </run>
            <run auto-url='true' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z0R9OsDl-10&amp;amp;ab_channel=Tableau&amp;quot;'>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z0R9OsDl-10&amp;ab_channel=Tableau</run>
            <run>

But there are a few caveats --
1.  it cannot break ties. i.e if you want to display top 5 and there are 10 items with the same top value , Tableau selects randomly 3 to display
2. it cannot order the stacked bars based onTop N  % Served Chats. reasons unknown

For a true list that overcomes these caveats please refer to &quot;RR CR Level 3 (no ties)&quot; viz</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='herocare_agent_platform_feature_performance' name='federated.0pdf7rx099164h12jy4fx1xahcvn' />
            <datasource name='Parameters' />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='Parameters'>
            <column caption='Date Granularity' datatype='string' name='[Parameter 1]' param-domain-type='list' role='measure' type='nominal' value='&quot;Week&quot;'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='&quot;Week&quot;' />
            </column>
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.0pdf7rx099164h12jy4fx1xahcvn'>
            <column caption='% used and not accepted' datatype='real' default-format='p0.0%' name='[% of fully accepted (copy)_5628795906307145746]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='SUM([Count Served Chats (copy)_5628795906289303560])/ [Count Served Chats RR not used (copy)_5628795906302361614]' />
            </column>
            <column caption='AHT RR not used (in mins)' datatype='real' default-format='n#,##0.0;-#,##0.0' name='[AHT (in mins) (copy)_5628795906611335197]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='SUM([Count Served Chats RR not used (copy)_5628795906308681749]) / SUM([Count Served Chats RR used and partially accepted (copy)_5628795906291478539]) / 60' />
            </column>
            <column caption='AHT RR used (in mins)' datatype='real' default-format='n#,##0.0;-#,##0.0' name='[AHT RR not used (in mins) (copy)_5628795906611707934]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='[Count Served Chats RR used (copy)_5628795906310119449] / [Count Served Chats RR not used (copy)_5628795906302361614] / 60' />
            </column>
            <column caption='AHT RR used and fully accepted (in mins)' datatype='real' default-format='n#,##0.0;-#,##0.0' name='[AHT RR not used (in mins) (copy)_5628795906611908639]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='SUM([Count Served Chats RR used and fully accepted (copy)_5628795906308890648]) / SUM([Count Served Chats RR used and partially accepted (copy)_5628795906291351562]) / 60' />
            </column>
            <column caption='AHT RR used and not accepted (in mins)' datatype='real' default-format='n#,##0.0;-#,##0.0' name='[AHT RR used and fully accepted (in mins) (copy)_5628795906612084768]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='SUM([Count Served Chats RR used and not accepted (copy)_5628795906308890646]) / SUM([Count Served Chats (copy)_5628795906289303560]) / 60' />
            </column>
            <column caption='AHT RR used and partially accepted (in mins)' datatype='real' default-format='n#,##0.0;-#,##0.0' name='[AHT RR used and not accepted (in mins) (copy)_5628795906612215841]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='SUM([Count Served Chats RR used and partially accepted (copy)_5628795906308890647]) / SUM([Count Served Chats RR used and not accepted (copy)_5628795906290397193]) / 60' />
