        <panes>
          <pane selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-allow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Shape' />
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true'>WHAT IS THE CHART BELOW ABOUT ? :</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555'>* The vertical bars represent </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555'>total served chats</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555'> split by the 4 color groups : </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#666666'>Æ </run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555'>       1. Reply Recommendation used and fully accepted in</run>
                <run fontcolor='#00814a'>Æ </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#00814a'>dark green</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555'>Æ        </run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555'>2. Reply Recommendation used and partially accepted in</run>
                <run fontcolor='#00814a'>Æ </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#33bc26'>light green</run>
                <run>Æ&#10; </run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555'>       3. Reply Recommendation used but not accepted in</run>
                <run fontcolor='#00814a'>Æ </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#cf0002'>dark red</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555'>        4. Reply Recommendation not used at all in</run>
                <run>Æ </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#00557f'>dark blue</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555'>* The 4 lines represent the evolution of a KPI selected by the user split by the 4 color groups mentioned above</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555'>* The X axis is the Date Granularity selected from the filters at the top ( Day, Week, Month )</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555'>* The Y axis is the value of the KPI selected by the user ( absolute numbers for AHT (in mins)  , percentage for CSAT )</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true'>HOW TO USE :</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555'>Click on </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' italic='true'>&apos;Select KPI&apos;  </run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555'>to select a desired KPI between CSAT or AHT (in mins) that you wish to see the evolution of </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true'>NOTE :</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555'>With no filters from the top selected , you may notice only </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#00557f'>dark blue </run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555'>vertical bars. This is because Reply Recommendations currently are enabled only for a handful of Contact Reasons. Please select relevant filters on the top to see all data for the 4 groups. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555'>Eg : We know that Reply Recommendations has been enabled for the Contact Reason &apos;Online Payment Issue&apos; in APAC for Customer Service English language. Therefore you can make the following selections : </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555'>Management Entity Group = &apos;Foodpanda APAC&apos; , Language = English&apos; , Stakeholder = &apos;Customer&apos; , CR Level 3 = &apos;Online Payment Issue&apos; </run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='mark'>
                <format attr='shape' value='Bug Tracking/light.png' />
              </style-rule>
              <style-rule element='trendline'>
                <format attr='stroke-size' value='0' />
                <format attr='line-visibility' value='off' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
          </pane>
        </panes>
